   "html": "We Have the<a href=\"@minelab-x-terra/\" data-kind=\"internal\"> Minelab Xterra 305</a>, initial set up Review and Field test, metal detecting on the beach plenty of silver coins one a really nice find and a ring and earing, a very capable <a href=\"@minelab-vanquish-60-series/\" data-kind=\"internal\">metal detector for beginners</a>, light weight easy to set up, mainly just switch on and go, but on the dry sand and slightly wet sand it really does perform well."
